{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09324","headline":"登重玄寺阁 · 韦应物","name":"登重玄寺阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时暇陟云构，晨霁澄景光。\n始见吴都大，十里郁苍苍。\n山川表明丽，湖海吞大荒。\n合沓臻水陆，骈阗会四方。\n俗繁节又暄，雨顺物亦康。\n禽鱼各翔泳，草木遍芬芳。\n於兹省甿俗，一用劝农桑。\n诚知虎符忝，但恨归路长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}